    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p19-q7-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "40 or less?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{211}{228}$",
          "worked": "There are $10+150+350+420+125+85=1140$ people in total.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{40 or less})&=\\frac{10+150+350+420+125}{1140}\\\\P(\\text{40 or less})&=\\frac{1055}{1140}=\\frac{211}{228}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "between 12 and 29?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{77}{114}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{between 12 and 29})&=\\frac{350+420}{1140}\\\\P(\\text{between 12 and 29})&=\\frac{770}{1140}=\\frac{77}{114}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q7-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "older than 11?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{49}{57}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{older than 11})&=\\frac{350+420+125+85}{1140}\\\\P(\\text{older than 11})&=\\frac{980}{1140}=\\frac{49}{57}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q7-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "older than 18 given they are older than 11?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{9}{14}$\n\nRestrict the sample space to the 980 people older than 11.",
          "worked": "The restricted sample space contains $350+420+125+85=980$ people older than 11. Of these, $420+125+85=630$ are older than 18.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{older than 18}\\mid\\text{older than 11})&=\\frac{630}{980}\\\\P(\\text{older than 18}\\mid\\text{older than 11})&=\\frac{9}{14}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q7-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "29 or less given that they are 40 or less?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{186}{211}$\n\nRestrict the sample space to the 1055 people aged 40 or less.",
          "worked": "The restricted sample space contains $10+150+350+420+125=1055$ people aged 40 or less. Of these, $10+150+350+420=930$ are aged 29 or less.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{29 or less}\\mid\\text{40 or less})&=\\frac{930}{1055}\\\\P(\\text{29 or less}\\mid\\text{40 or less})&=\\frac{186}{211}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
